# Module 2 backend — deployed separately to a HuggingFace Space (see
# api/README.md), never to Vercel. Without this, Vercel auto-detects
# api/requirements.txt and tries to build it as a Python Serverless
# Function, which fails: the ML deps (torch, transformers, gliner,
# sentence-transformers, ...) bundle to several GB, far past Vercel's
# 500MB function size limit.
api/
